  "about": "The Gradual of the formulary “Purification of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We have received Your mercy, O God, in the midst of Your temple. As is Your name, O God, so too is Your praise, to the ends of the earth. As we have heard, so too have we seen, in the city of our God, on His holy mountain." }
